WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:59.129
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:59.399 --> 01:03.988
[Apocalypse Log 17]

3
01:14.528 --> 01:18.111
Has he... always been like this?

4
01:20.708 --> 01:22.500
Ever since he was brought in.

5
01:22.500 --> 01:26.791
In a sense, this stable manic state is actually safer.

6
01:26.791 --> 01:29.000
At least, I know what he'll do next.

7
01:29.000 --> 01:31.000
Nothing more than hitting the bars.

8
01:31.750 --> 01:33.375
So...

9
01:34.250 --> 01:36.375
Can we start the experiment today?

10
01:36.375 --> 01:38.708
What do you need me to do?

11
01:38.708 --> 01:40.198
Let's draw some blood first

12
01:40.198 --> 01:42.569
for antibody screening, virus inhibition experiments,

13
01:42.569 --> 01:45.069
and immune cell function analysis.

14
01:48.083 --> 01:49.666
Come over here.

15
02:06.958 --> 02:08.500
Sit here.

16
02:17.250 --> 02:18.375
Roll up your sleeve.

17
02:18.375 --> 02:20.208
Keep your arm flat.

18
02:41.416 --> 02:42.916
Relax.

19
02:42.916 --> 02:44.416
Make a fist.

20
03:16.833 --> 03:18.333
Relax.

21
03:25.000 --> 03:26.375
How much do you need to draw?

22
03:26.375 --> 03:28.458
Make sure it's enough.

23
03:28.458 --> 03:30.541
We'll start with the standard amount.

24
03:43.500 --> 03:47.041
With this, how long until we see results?

25
03:47.041 --> 03:48.583
Press down on this.

26
03:50.916 --> 03:52.250
Science isn't magic.

27
03:52.250 --> 03:54.465
Lin Zai, I need time for analysis,

28
03:54.465 --> 03:55.887
cultivation, and testing.

29
03:55.887 --> 03:56.917
Be patient.

30
03:56.917 --> 03:59.416
It's for your brother's safety, too.

31
03:59.416 --> 04:00.875
I can be patient.

32
04:00.875 --> 04:03.125
As long as I can save my brother.

33
04:03.791 --> 04:06.352
Then start by maintaining your own health.

34
04:06.352 --> 04:07.666
We'll draw more in a couple of days.

35
04:07.666 --> 04:09.875
I need to do a dynamic comparison.

36
04:16.300 --> 04:18.750
Come. Lie down.

37
04:21.041 --> 04:22.541
Okay.

38
04:23.708 --> 04:26.542
Today we'll do some basic examinations and sample collection.

39
04:26.542 --> 04:28.308
I need to ensure your physical condition

40
04:28.308 --> 04:30.583
can handle the subsequent extractions.

41
04:30.583 --> 04:31.956
We can't have you collapsing

42
04:31.956 --> 04:33.583
before the antidote is ready.

43
04:33.583 --> 04:34.875
I'm very healthy.

44
04:34.875 --> 04:37.541
I didn't even get a fever after being bitten.

45
04:37.541 --> 04:39.166
That's not for you to decide.

46
04:39.166 --> 04:40.666
Lie still.

47
04:49.875 --> 04:51.708
The man in the video...

48
04:51.708 --> 04:53.666
What's his situation now?

49
04:59.833 --> 05:01.958
He was originally at...

50
05:02.583 --> 05:04.500
Green Island Airport.

51
05:04.500 --> 05:06.333
Green Island Airport?

52
05:07.208 --> 05:10.833
Is he your brother?

53
05:10.833 --> 05:13.041
- But... - Actually, we didn't lose contact then.

54
05:13.041 --> 05:15.166
It's just that his condition was special.

55
05:15.166 --> 05:18.083
I couldn't tell you about his existence.

56
05:20.875 --> 05:22.693
His name is Sheng Chang Huan.

57
05:22.693 --> 05:24.583
Our families have been friends for generations.

58
05:24.583 --> 05:26.583
After my parents died in a car accident,

59
05:26.583 --> 05:29.583
I was fostered at his home.

60
05:29.583 --> 05:31.125
Then how did he...

61
05:31.125 --> 05:33.208
How did he end up like that?

62
05:35.041 --> 05:36.958
After the apocalypse,

63
05:37.750 --> 05:39.833
he was bitten by a zombie.

64
05:39.833 --> 05:42.500
I used all the reagents I had on him.

65
05:42.500 --> 05:45.500
It slowed down his transformation.

66
05:45.500 --> 05:48.125
But Casia found out.

67
05:48.791 --> 05:51.208
They wanted to control us.

68
05:51.208 --> 05:52.916
I had no choice but to flee with him.

69
05:52.916 --> 05:55.333
Just as we reached Green Island Airport,

70
05:55.333 --> 05:57.667
Casia's people caught up to us.

71
05:58.625 --> 06:01.041
That was the day we met.

72
06:01.041 --> 06:02.458
Yes.

73
06:02.458 --> 06:04.125
I wanted to take him with me then.

74
06:04.125 --> 06:06.583
I had to trap you two and steal the car.

75
06:06.583 --> 06:10.083
But... I got away too late.

76
06:10.083 --> 06:12.480
When I went back for him,

77
06:12.480 --> 06:15.208
he'd already been taken by Casia's men.

78
06:19.542 --> 06:21.417
So, that's what happened.

79
06:23.166 --> 06:26.000
Casia has been tracking me ever since.

80
06:26.000 --> 06:29.796
I'm very sorry for keeping this from you.

81
06:35.333 --> 06:37.124
I understand.

82
06:38.458 --> 06:41.666
So, it's not just for my brother.

83
06:45.291 --> 06:49.125
For both of us, this is an experiment

84
06:49.875 --> 06:52.000
that we cannot afford to lose.

85
07:37.208 --> 07:40.125
Where were you? I've been looking for you.

86
07:42.583 --> 07:43.833
Nowhere.

87
07:43.833 --> 07:45.541
Just walking around.

88
07:47.125 --> 07:48.291
Lin Zai.

89
07:48.291 --> 07:50.875
If anything's wrong, you must tell me.

90
07:54.416 --> 07:55.958
Lie.

91
07:55.958 --> 07:59.041
Don't you think you're being too controlling lately?

92
08:01.666 --> 08:02.791
Lin Zai.

93
08:02.791 --> 08:04.125
What is wrong with you?

94
08:04.125 --> 08:06.375
We were doing fine before.

95
08:13.666 --> 08:15.250
Can't you act normal?

96
08:15.250 --> 08:17.583
I don't like this.

97
08:17.583 --> 08:19.041
Stop following me all the time.

98
08:19.041 --> 08:21.083
Give me some personal space.

99
09:15.500 --> 09:17.541
Chang Huan.

100
09:17.541 --> 09:19.166
Chang Huan.

101
09:25.916 --> 09:27.458
Brother.

102
09:34.375 --> 09:35.375
How is it?

103
09:35.375 --> 09:37.166
How do you feel?

104
09:41.208 --> 09:44.416
- What's all this? - Just some new equipment I set up.

105
09:47.791 --> 09:49.625
How do you feel?

106
09:56.541 --> 09:58.750
This isn't your blood.

107
09:59.875 --> 10:01.333
You can tell?

108
10:01.333 --> 10:03.208
What's different?

109
10:03.958 --> 10:05.625
It feels very different.

110
10:05.625 --> 10:07.541
The noise in my head...

111
10:07.541 --> 10:09.833
it's all gone.

112
10:09.833 --> 10:12.916
And... since I became like this,

113
10:12.916 --> 10:15.708
this is the most lucid I've ever been.

114
10:15.708 --> 10:16.833
It is different.

115
10:16.833 --> 10:20.083
Chang Huan, I found an immune body.

116
10:21.125 --> 10:22.458
An immune body?

117
10:22.458 --> 10:24.958
Do they really exist?

118
10:24.958 --> 10:28.083
Chang Huan, I told you I would cure you.

119
10:28.083 --> 10:30.666
The data doesn't lie.

120
10:31.375 --> 10:33.291
Your neurological responses, your consciousness...

121
10:33.291 --> 10:35.625
the recovery is much more significant than before.

122
10:35.625 --> 10:39.083
It's still unstable, but we're on the right path.

123
10:39.083 --> 10:41.375
We've found the key, Chang Huan.

124
10:43.753 --> 10:45.253
But...

125
10:46.208 --> 10:48.000
The immune body...

126
10:48.000 --> 10:52.208
That person... are they okay?

127
10:52.958 --> 10:54.250
Don't worry.

128
10:54.250 --> 10:55.833
He's a volunteer.

129
10:55.833 --> 10:57.791
He knows what he's doing.

130
10:57.791 --> 10:59.541
He also has someone he must save.

131
10:59.541 --> 11:01.541
We're partners.

132
11:02.250 --> 11:05.291
Then... he wasn't harmed?

133
11:05.291 --> 11:07.750
I'll control the volume and frequency of the blood draws.

134
11:07.750 --> 11:09.583
I'll try to minimize the impact on him.

135
11:09.583 --> 11:11.458
I'll also ensure his safety.

136
11:11.458 --> 11:13.041
This is our hope...

137
11:14.166 --> 11:16.416
and his only hope as well.

138
11:20.250 --> 11:21.583
Come on.

139
11:21.583 --> 11:23.958
- Try to get up and walk. - Okay.

140
11:26.166 --> 11:28.542
Slowly. Don't rush.

141
11:30.166 --> 11:31.333
How do you feel?

142
11:31.333 --> 11:33.375
Any discomfort?

143
11:34.208 --> 11:35.708
I feel good.

144
11:45.666 --> 11:49.291
By the way, is the antibody titer stable?

145
11:49.291 --> 11:50.875
Regarding the specific mechanism of virus neutralization,

146
11:50.875 --> 11:53.000
are there any new findings?

147
11:53.000 --> 11:54.833
If the effect lasts,

148
11:54.833 --> 11:57.416
does that mean our previous

149
11:57.416 --> 11:59.416
pre-fusion conformation stability hypothesis

150
11:59.416 --> 12:02.250
is on the right track for in vitro neutralization?

151
12:05.125 --> 12:06.167
Look.

152
12:06.167 --> 12:07.583
The titer is extremely high.

153
12:07.583 --> 12:08.625
And it seems to promote

154
12:08.625 --> 12:10.738
signs of self-repair in damaged nerve cells.

155
12:10.738 --> 12:11.997
It's not just neutralization.

156
12:11.997 --> 12:13.791
The mechanism is more complex than we thought.

157
12:13.791 --> 12:15.291
It involves immunomodulation.

158
12:15.291 --> 12:18.500
Yes. Pre-fusion conformation stability might be the key.

159
12:18.500 --> 12:19.750
The immune body's antibodies

160
12:19.750 --> 12:22.208
seem to recognize the conserved epitopes we overlooked before.

161
12:22.208 --> 12:23.708
And this...

162
12:23.708 --> 12:24.708
This...

163
12:24.708 --> 12:26.458
Look at these parameters.

164
12:26.458 --> 12:27.750
They're all different.

165
12:27.750 --> 12:29.208
Truly.

166
12:29.208 --> 12:32.125
They're different from what we had before.

167
12:32.125 --> 12:34.625
We've really found the key.

168
12:47.239 --> 12:48.625
Your period of lucidity

169
12:48.625 --> 12:51.375
has far exceeded any previous time.

170
12:52.625 --> 12:54.375
Sleep peacefully, Chang Huan.

171
12:54.375 --> 12:57.958
This time, we will definitely make things return to how they were.

172
12:57.958 --> 12:59.458
Definitely.

173
13:40.121 --> 13:43.580
How are things on your end?

174
13:43.580 --> 13:46.080
Don't worry. It's better than expected.

175
13:46.080 --> 13:47.788
We can continue.

176
13:47.788 --> 13:49.121
How are you feeling?

177
13:49.121 --> 13:50.167
I'm fine.

178
13:50.167 --> 13:52.663
Don't worry about me.

179
13:52.663 --> 13:54.288
I found some wild fruits.

180
13:54.288 --> 13:55.496
They're a bit sour,

181
13:55.496 --> 13:57.996
but they're a good source of vitamins.

182
14:00.038 --> 14:02.163
I'll bring them to you later.

183
14:02.913 --> 14:05.163
- I'll head off first. - Okay.

184
14:21.371 --> 14:23.080
Is something wrong?

185
14:26.538 --> 14:30.000
What exactly are you after by getting close to him?

186
14:31.875 --> 14:33.496
Hey, man.

187
14:33.496 --> 14:35.292
What do you mean?

188
14:35.292 --> 14:38.474
Lin Zai and I were just helping each other and chatting.

189
14:38.474 --> 14:39.955
In a place like this,

190
14:39.955 --> 14:42.621
there aren't many people to talk to.

191
14:42.621 --> 14:46.121
Helping? Chatting?

192
14:46.121 --> 14:48.121
His expression didn't look right.

193
14:48.121 --> 14:50.580
What were you two whispering about?

194
14:52.163 --> 14:54.121
Lin Zai seems a bit tired lately.

195
14:54.121 --> 14:55.623
I was just showing concern for a comrade.

196
14:55.623 --> 14:57.708
And sharing some food I found.

197
14:57.708 --> 14:59.833
Is there a problem with that?

198
15:01.288 --> 15:02.746
As for you,

199
15:02.746 --> 15:06.163
Lin Zai doesn't seem to want to talk to you much.

200
15:06.163 --> 15:08.333
Aren't you being too controlling?

201
15:08.333 --> 15:11.548
Wouldn't it be better to give him some space?

202
15:17.290 --> 15:19.373
Stay away from him.

203
15:20.081 --> 15:22.747
Don't let me see you near him again.

204
15:22.747 --> 15:24.581
Otherwise...

205
16:39.581 --> 16:41.665
So, you were awake.

206
16:54.623 --> 16:56.331
Lie.

207
16:56.331 --> 17:00.456
Do you always ignore what I say?

208
17:05.081 --> 17:06.873
I gave you the space you wanted.

209
17:06.873 --> 17:08.748
And what's the result?

210
17:09.998 --> 17:11.331
I take a step back,

211
17:11.331 --> 17:13.415
and you take a step toward someone else.

212
17:13.415 --> 17:16.250
Who is He Yao? How much do you really know about him?

213
17:16.250 --> 17:19.708
He approaches you for no reason, and you just trust him?

214
17:20.706 --> 17:23.748
Lin Zai, he's dangerous.

215
17:23.748 --> 17:26.373
You have no idea what he wants from you.

216
17:26.373 --> 17:28.456
- His identity- - Enough.

217
17:29.748 --> 17:32.415
Don't make this about someone else.

218
17:37.706 --> 17:40.708
You want an answer, don't you?

219
17:40.708 --> 17:42.784
Fine.

220
17:42.784 --> 17:45.034
I'll tell you right now.

221
17:48.706 --> 17:51.831
Between us, it's impossible.

222
17:53.123 --> 17:55.708
Everything that happened before...

223
17:55.708 --> 17:57.623
Let's pretend it never happened.

224
17:57.623 --> 17:59.290
This ends here.

225
18:01.081 --> 18:02.373
Why?

226
18:02.373 --> 18:03.873
Why?

227
18:06.040 --> 18:07.873
Because you're a mercenary,

228
18:07.873 --> 18:10.331
and I'm just an ordinary person.

229
18:16.331 --> 18:18.665
We're not from the same world.

230
18:19.581 --> 18:22.748
Lie, you've just...

231
18:24.165 --> 18:26.915
You've just been alone for too long.

232
18:26.915 --> 18:30.248
You mistook that impulse for love.

233
18:39.415 --> 18:42.581
I'm not a fool. I know how I feel.

234
18:44.041 --> 18:46.041
I'm happy when I see you smile.

235
18:46.041 --> 18:47.583
When I see you sad, my heart feels heavy.

236
18:47.583 --> 18:50.666
When I see you near someone else, I feel uneasy all over.

237
18:54.625 --> 18:56.458
The first time I kissed you...

238
19:01.875 --> 19:05.041
I didn't know why I did it.

239
19:05.041 --> 19:07.958
But... after the kiss,

240
19:08.916 --> 19:11.333
it reminded me of when I was a kid...

241
19:12.667 --> 19:15.292
Back when I had a proper meal for the first time.

242
19:23.500 --> 19:25.041
Lin Zai.

243
19:27.875 --> 19:29.625
I love you.

244
19:40.750 --> 19:42.570
But I don't love you.

245
19:44.958 --> 19:46.791
I don't believe you.

246
19:46.791 --> 19:48.542
I don't...
